& [UserIntent]
  + continue from the published pure semantic inspection wire toward a runnable Cantor agent process
  + form the smallest executable boundary that can accept one semantic inspection request and return one exact response
  + preserve auditability deterministic refusal bounded resources and the live C checkout while withholding every broader host provider model update remote and product effect

